     1,
     "<div>Boostrap has some very nice dropdown buttons that I would like to use to replace a selectInput. It would allow for submenus, separators, etc. I can use HTML() in ui.R to setup a select as used in the html-ui tutorial and can do something similar with a dropdown. But,  is it possible to use a Boostrap dropdown to do the work of a selectInput?</div><div><br></div><a href=\"http://twitter.github.com/bootstrap/components.html#buttonDropdowns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://twitter.github.com/bootstrap/components.html%23buttonDropdowns&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792410182805000&amp;usg=AOvVaw09sUxgD3PFic8OW-F6CCMB\">http://twitter.github.com/bootstrap/components.html#buttonDropdowns</a><br><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"padding:8.5px;font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.025px;color:rgb(0,0,0);border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;margin-bottom:9px;line-height:18px;word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.14902)\"><code style=\"font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;color:inherit;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;background-color:transparent\">    <span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85);font-weight:bold\">select</span> name=<span style=\"color:rgb(42,0,255)\">&quot;dist&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85)\">&gt;</span>\r\n      <span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85);font-weight:bold\">option</span> value=<span style=\"color:rgb(42,0,255)\">&quot;norm&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85)\">&gt;</span>Normal<span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85)\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85);font-weight:bold\">option</span><span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85)\">&gt;</span>\r\n      <span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85);font-weight:bold\">option</span> value=<span style=\"color:rgb(42,0,255)\">&quot;unif&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85)\">&gt;</span>Uniform<span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85)\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85);font-weight:bold\">option</span><span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85)\">&gt;</span>\r\n      <span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85);font-weight:bold\">option</span> value=<span style=\"color:rgb(42,0,255)\">&quot;lnorm&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85)\">&gt;</span>Log-normal<span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85)\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85);font-weight:bold\">option</span><span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85)\">&gt;</span>\r\n      <span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85);font-weight:bold\">option</span> value=<span style=\"color:rgb(42,0,255)\">&quot;exp&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85)\">&gt;</span>Exponential<span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85)\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85);font-weight:bold\">option</span><span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85)\">&gt;</span>\r\n    <span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85)\">&lt;/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85);font-weight:bold\">select</span><span style=\"color:rgb(127,0,85)\">&gt;</span> </code></pre><pre style=\"padding:8.5px;font-family:&#39;DejaVu Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Droid Sans Mono&#39;,&#39;Lucida Console&#39;,Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.025px;color:rgb(0,0,0);border-top-left-radius:4px;border-top-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-right-radius:4px;border-bottom-left-radius:4px;margin-bottom:9px;line-height:18px;word-break:break-all;word-wrap:break-word;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.1490