style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">runif</span>,\r\n                   <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">lnorm</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">rlnorm</span>,\r\n                   <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">exp</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">rexp</span>,\r\n                   <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">rnorm</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span>\r\n  <span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">}</span><span style=\"color:rgb(104,118,135)\">)</span></code></pre></code></pre></div>"
